        "12 oz penne pasta dry (yields about 6 cups cooked, 1.5 cups per serving)",
        "2 cups cherry tomatoes, halved",
        "1 medium zucchini, diced small",
        "1 tbsp olive oil (total)",
        "1 cup low-sodium chicken broth",
        "2 tbsp tomato paste",
        "4 tbsp shredded parmesan cheese (1 tbsp per serving)"
      ],
      "steps": [
