        "Add halved cherry tomatoes and cook 3-4 more minutes until tomatoes soften and sauce thickens slightly.",
        "Toss cooked pasta into the skillet and mix everything together.",
        "Serve 1.5 cups pasta mixture per serving, topped with 1 tbsp parmesan cheese."
      ],
      "kids_tasks": [
        "Toddlers can help rinse cherry tomatoes in a colander.",
        "Toddlers can sprinkle parmesan cheese on bowls with supervision."
